OL,3,AAt least 27 dead and hundreds evacuated
OL,4,Aafter strikes near Kyiv
OL,5,
OL,6,FTkachenko later added that a
OL,7,F14-year-old was killed in a separate
OL,8,Fattack in the Boryspil district. "This
OL,9,Fis yet another victim of Russian
OL,10,Fterror," he said.
